{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1173","id":3976866510,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tCirO","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1173","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1173.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1173.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1173","number":1173,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Add full 9709 beta runtime readiness plan","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Adds the V1 full 9709 beta runtime coverage decision record, making all 3530 real 9709 question rows the beta question availability universe.\n- Adds the FigureAsset/runtime readiness implementation plan for full-beta source maps, visual-required inventory, VLM candidate packets, rights/display overlays, Supabase Phase B0/B1 rehearsal refresh, and posture-aware runtime handoffs.\n- Registers the new plan in `docs/reports/INDEX.md` and marks the July 1 governance state as superseded where it could be read as a small served-subset runtime gate.\n\n## Why\n\nThe previous V1 governance trail could still be interpreted as making the 8-row calibration packet, 1203 served-eligible candidate pool, or old unserved-backlog boundary the runtime availability gate. This PR records the updated boundary: Method Map confidence can downgrade diagnostic strength, but it must not block a real question from beta attempt/logging flows.\n\nRequired visual content remains separate. Missing diagrams, graphs, charts, tables, or layout-dependent visuals can block valid student-facing display until FigureAsset, SourceVisualReceipt, fallback, and rights/display policy gates are satisfied.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --cached --check` before the original commit: passed.\n- `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD`: passed.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` on the clean PR branch: passed.\n- `git diff --name-status origin/main...HEAD` on the clean PR branch: exactly 4 target files.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` on the clean PR branch before push: workspace clean; warning only because the branch was ahead before push; report/artifact guard passed.\n\n## Notes\n\nDocs-only change. No runtime code, source artifact generation, DB/schema change, remote Supabase mutation, frontend change, or production/launch/readiness claim.\n\nA previous draft PR from the reused squash-merged branch had a noisy merge-base diff; this clean branch was created from current `origin/main` and carries only the intended docs commit.","created_at":"2026-07-02T08:51:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T08:55:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T08:54:58Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T08:54:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"76a9611f93d9993c48d48e956ba93b17d4c19403","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1173/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-h